<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Welcome to Smart Agile System</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; }
        .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .content { margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #777; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 10px; }
        .password-box { background: #f4f4f4; padding: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-family: monospace; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #007bff; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 15px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Welcome to {{companyName}}</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
            <p>An administrator has just created an account for you on the Smart Agile System.</p>
            <p>Your temporary password to log in is:</p>
            <div class="password-box">{{temporaryPassword}}</div>
            <p>For your security, please log in and change this password immediately.</p>

            <p>If you have any questions, please contact your system administrator.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{year}} {{companyName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
